        "TileImage": "$($repository 293445ef-f9d7-483f-bf90-1c87a10f046e).Image",
        "Description": "47, we have finally found the person withholding that incriminating evidence. It is none other than Steven Benton, a journalist working for &quot;The Miami Times.&quot; Having probably bought them to make his next scoop, he has, thankfully, not published the article yet.\rHe is currently at the Miami race track, taking notes in order to prepare an article on it.\rHe is expected to spend his day on the fairly unguarded ground floor of the Krondstadt bayside center.\rGood luck, 47.",
